Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:30.00,Tag,,0,0,0,,VXO · AI-made · characters are AI
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:01.13,Vee,,0,0,0,,How much did your
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.14,0:00:03.13,Vee,,0,0,0,,last product shoot cost?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.50,0:00:05.33,Otto,,0,0,0,,Don't answer. It'll ruin
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.26,0:00:06.21,Otto,,0,0,0,,your coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.80,0:00:08.55,Vee,,0,0,0,,We make thirty-second product
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.48,0:00:10.31,Vee,,0,0,0,,films with AI. One
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.24,0:00:12.23,Vee,,0,0,0,,take. No crew. No
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.16,0:00:13.19,Vee,,0,0,0,,studio.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.80,0:00:15.87,Otto,,0,0,0,,Just your product, and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.96,0:00:17.47,Otto,,0,0,0,,a little madness.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.20,0:00:20.19,Vee,,0,0,0,,Send us one photo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.12,0:00:21.39,Vee,,0,0,0,,We send back five
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.32,0:00:22.91,Vee,,0,0,0,,frames, free.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.60,0:00:25.27,Otto,,0,0,0,,Then we roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.20,0:00:27.79,Vee,,0,0,0,,Link in bio.
